== 8. Forgot Password - Verify OTP (Resident) ==
RES -> APP : Enter OTP
APP -> GW : POST /auth/forgot-password/verify-otp\n{email, otp}
GW -> API : Forward request
API -> DB : Validate OTP
alt Missing email or OTP
    API --> GW : 400 Bad Request\n"email and otp are required"
    GW --> APP : 400
    APP --> RES : Email and OTP are required
else Invalid OTP format
    API --> GW : 400 Bad Request\n"OTP must be 6 digits"
    GW --> APP : 400
    APP --> RES : OTP must be 6 digits
else Invalid OTP
    API --> GW : 400 Bad Request\n"Invalid OTP"
    GW --> APP : 400
    APP --> RES : Incorrect OTP entered
else OTP expired
    API --> GW : 410 Gone\n"OTP expired"
    GW --> APP : 410
    APP --> RES : OTP has expired, request new one
else Email not found
    API --> GW : 404 Not Found\n"Email not found"
    GW --> APP : 404
    APP --> RES : Email not registered
else Too many attempts
    API --> GW : 429 Too Many Requests\n"Too many verification attempts"
    GW --> APP : 429
    APP --> RES : Too many attempts, request new OTP
else Server error
    API --> GW : 500 Internal Server Error
    GW --> APP : 500
    APP --> RES : Something went wrong, try again
else Valid
    API --> GW : 200 {resetToken}
    GW --> APP : 200 {resetToken}
    APP --> RES : Proceed to reset password
end

